    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Weapon (Dagger, Rapier, Scimitar, Shortsword, Sickle, or Spear), Common (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>While this weapon is on your person, you understand the nonwritten communication of all Fey, and they understand yours.</p><p><strong>Secret Message.</strong> As a Magic action, you can use the weapon to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMessage000]{Message}. Once this property is used, it can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-qElNt2kC2TxwVOmr\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Glissez l’enchantement sur l’arme voulue : elle garde son nom, sa rareté et son prix. Elle reçoit l’activité <em>Secret Message</em>, une fois par aube.</p></section><p>@Embed[Compendium.dnd5e.content24.JournalEntry.dmgFoundryRefere.JournalEntryPage.Ok4iCgD25ENgoRxE cite=false caption=false classes=\"hide-in-embed\"]</p>",
